uplink-adt-shield-handheld-diffuser-name = Portable Shield Diffuser
uplink-adt-shield-handheld-diffuser-desc = A small handheld device designed to disrupt energy barriers. It disrupts shields in a small radius around itself. Runs on a standard power cell.

# Shield modes
shield-mode-hyperkinetic = Hyperkinetic Projectiles
shield-mode-hyperkinetic-desc = Blocks various fast moving physical objects, such as bullets, blunt weapons and meteors.

shield-mode-photonic = Photonic Dispersion
shield-mode-photonic-desc = Blocks the majority of energy weaponry and beams.

shield-mode-humanoids = Humanoid Lifeforms
shield-mode-humanoids-desc = Blocks humanoid lifeforms. Does not affect fully synthetic humanoids.

shield-mode-anorganic = Silicon Lifeforms
shield-mode-anorganic-desc = Blocks silicon based lifeforms: cyborgs, drones, IPCs.

shield-mode-atmospheric = Atmospheric Containment
shield-mode-atmospheric-desc = Blocks air flow and acts as atmosphere containment.

shield-mode-modulate = Adaptive Field Harmonics
shield-mode-modulate-desc = Modulates the shield harmonic frequencies, allowing the field to adapt to various damage types.

shield-mode-bypass = Diffuser Bypass
shield-mode-bypass-desc = Disables the built-in safeties which allows the generator to counter the effect of various shield diffusers. This tends to create a very large strain on the generator. Requires hacking.

shield-mode-overcharge = Field Overcharge
shield-mode-overcharge-desc = Polarises the field, causing damage on contact. Very harmful to all life. Requires hacking.